;---------------------------------------
; BEGIN DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------
<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "エデンの桜\Amblygo.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>Leaving the underground storeroom, I headed for the storehouse.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In yesterday's translation, I would set down everything I had done today.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I would pass on to later generations what I had done, and how one could escape the threat of Shigatsu Youka.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
On the way, I looked up at the cherry tree left standing at the Niimura main house.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Ko-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">This is right, isn't it?"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\リファレンス用\町娘背景\枯れ木.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n798\r\n000\r\n4\r\n0\r\n10000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{MESON "500"}
This is a part of Shigatsu Youka.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A part of the Goddess who has made her nest in the land of Arata.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It is because of this that the curse-killings happen, and people turn into cherry trees and vanish.<PG>
Since I came here, no one has disappeared.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Probably because Shigatsu Youka was wary of me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Shigatsu Youka has intelligence.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
To reproduce, it uses humans, manipulates them, and takes their lives.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Because I was there, aware of that possibility, Shigatsu Youka could make no great move.<PG>
But fortunately, after the deaths of <STYLE ID="2">Ko-san</STYLE> and his mother, I had given up my research on Droga.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If I had continued my research, my own life might have been in danger as well.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Yes, <STYLE ID="2">Ko-san</STYLE> and his mother were killed by Shigatsu Youka―
{PAUSE ""}
I am certain of it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But―<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Ko-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Surely I do not have long either."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I had handed over many of the cherry trees to <STYLE ID="3">Shinozaki-san</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
With that, Shigatsu Youka was brought all at once to the <STYLE ID="4" RUBY="ひん">brink</STYLE> of destruction.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If its true nature became known, Droga would surely stop being used, and it would no longer be able to reproduce.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Yet if it killed me, my suspicious death would only make <STYLE ID="3">Shinozaki-san</STYLE> see it as all the more dangerous.<PG>
For these 6 years, I have managed to hold Shigatsu Youka's movements in check.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If Droga goes on unused like this, and there is falsificaso ready for when it is needed, our descendants can be protected from the threat of Shigatsu Youka.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Ko-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">... I..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Shigatsu Youka has already been checkmated.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It has lost its fruiting bodies, and the threat of Droga has become known―
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Yes, Shigatsu Youka has nothing more to lose.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even if it kills me, it has nothing left to lose.<PG>
So I felt regret.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That I had not written the rest of the translation sooner.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That I was walking this road alone.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And―
{PAUSE ""}
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
that I had sensed its presence.<PG>
{MESOFF "0"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Kikyo</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\アポカリプティック大.ogg" "SE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{PLAYMOVIE "111.wmv" "256" "C" "C" "REPEAT" "FALSE" "200" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n255\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n255\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{MESON "500"}
I had been lost in thought for a moment when something brightly colored caught my eye.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "SE" "5000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "エデンの桜\絶対何か居る雰囲気のアレ.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n50\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\リファレンス用\町娘背景\枯れ木.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "T" "100" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n50\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "エデンの桜\SE\菌糸.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "111" "$001313" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\荒田桜1.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "3000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Though it was still only February, cherry blossoms were dancing before my eyes.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
At the same time, a voice I knew, one I had long missed.<PG>
Shigatsu Youka was moving.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The air was far too freezing to call this out-of-season blooming.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
As if to say, what of it, the cherry blossoms danced.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Kikyo</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, it's been a while."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\リファレンス用\立ち絵\晃\晃御使い.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "100" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
There stood a young man.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The same figure as in my last memory of him.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Against the old woman I had become, a figure <STYLE ID="5" RUBY="あふ">brimming</STYLE> with youth.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Yes, <STYLE ID="6" RUBY="しにがみ">Ko-san</STYLE> had come for me.
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n0\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1,111" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="STOPMOVIE">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
